    "title": "Kestrel Health and Northstar Data: technical and commercial review",
    "documentClass": "CallTranscript",
    "sourceDatetime": "2026-10-14T16:00:00Z",
    "sourceDateLabel": "Wed, Oct 14, 2026 · 16:00 UTC",
    "sampleNote": "Real Factoid output from examples/demo",
    "participants": [
      "Maya Lin (Northstar Data)",
      "Devon Brooks (Northstar Data)",
      "Elena Ortiz (Kestrel Health)",
      "Samir Patel (Kestrel Health)"
    ]
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "speaker": "Maya Lin",
      "role": "account executive, Northstar Data",
      "side": "vendor",
      "timestamp": "00:12",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s1-1",
          "text": "Thanks for making time this afternoon, Elena and Samir."
        },
        {
          "id": "s1-2",
          "text": "I want to walk through your timeline, pricing, and security checklist so we leave with clear next steps."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "speaker": "Elena Ortiz",
      "role": "VP of Data Platform, Kestrel Health",
      "side": "customer",
      "timestamp": "00:46",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s2-1",
          "text": "Sure, happy to jump in."
        },
        {
          "id": "s2-2",
          "text": "Our nightly billing pipelines on Redshift are missing their 6:00 AM SLA about three times a week, so leadership wants us off it soon."
        },
        {
          "id": "s2-3",
          "text": "Right now we are targeting December 1, 2026 to cut over to a new analytics platform."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "speaker": "Devon Brooks",
      "role": "solutions engineer, Northstar Data",
      "side": "vendor",
      "timestamp": "01:38",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s3-1",
          "text": "Got it, that helps frame the migration."
        },
        {
          "id": "s3-2",
          "text": "How many people will need access in the first wave?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t4",
      "speaker": "Elena Ortiz",
      "role": "VP of Data Platform, Kestrel Health",
      "side": "customer",
      "timestamp": "02:05",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s4-1",
          "text": "We are planning on 45 analyst seats for the initial rollout, and we need annual fixed pricing rather than metered billing."
        },
        {
          "id": "s4-2",
          "text": "Finance hates surprise overage invoices at quarter end."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t5",
      "speaker": "Maya Lin",
      "role": "account executive, Northstar Data",
      "side": "vendor",
      "timestamp": "02:51",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s5-1",
          "text": "That fits our Enterprise tier."
        },
        {
          "id": "s5-2",
          "text": "For Enterprise, pricing is $96,000 a year for 45 seats, and that includes SAML SSO and full audit logs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "speaker": "Samir Patel",
      "role": "Head of Security, Kestrel Health",
      "side": "customer",
      "timestamp": "04:10",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s6-1",
          "text": "Before legal can countersign anything, we need your current SOC 2 Type II report."
        },
        {
          "id": "s6-2",
          "text": "We also require customer-managed encryption keys in AWS KMS for any production patient-billing data."
        },
        {
          "id": "s6-3",
          "text": "Our internal security review usually takes three weeks once those docs land."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t7",
      "speaker": "Samir Patel",
      "role": "Head of Security, Kestrel Health",
      "side": "customer",
      "timestamp": "05:24",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s7-1",
          "text": "One quick flag on scope before we go further."
        },
        {
          "id": "s7-2",
          "text": "Finance only approved 30 analyst seats for the initial rollout in this morning's budget check, not 45."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t8",
      "speaker": "Elena Ortiz",
      "role": "VP of Data Platform, Kestrel Health",
      "side": "customer",
      "timestamp": "06:18",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s8-1",
          "text": "Fair point, Samir."
        },
        {
          "id": "s8-2",
          "text": "I will reconcile the seat count with finance after this call."
        },
        {
          "id": "s8-3",
          "text": "And with a three-week security review plus the December freeze, let's move our target cutover date to January 18, 2027."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t9",
      "speaker": "Devon Brooks",
      "role": "solutions engineer, Northstar Data",
      "side": "vendor",
      "timestamp": "07:02",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s9-1",
          "text": "I will send our SOC 2 Type II report and AWS KMS architecture brief to Samir by this Friday."
        },
        {
          "id": "s9-2",
          "text": "Let me know if your team wants a sandbox before then."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t10",
      "speaker": "Maya Lin",
      "role": "account executive, Northstar Data",
      "side": "vendor",
      "timestamp": "07:35",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s10-1",
          "text": "Sounds good, thanks both of you."
        },
        {
          "id": "s10-2",
          "text": "I will follow up with a recap email later today."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
